{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `x1_sim` (reshaped as a vector equal to Stan `to_vector` of the original `matrix[N_node, N_time] x1_sim`).

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: reshaped `x1_sim` in `data_safe.json` to `[original_x1_sim[1, 1], ..., original_x1_sim[N_node, 1], original_x1_sim[1, 2], ...]`, i.e. Stan column-major order, so the likelihood can score the protected data once with a plain top-level sampling statement. Reordered the three parameter priors before any model-block use of those parameters, and vectorized the elementwise `x0` prior. Replaced the nested indexed likelihood with `x1_sim ~ normal(to_vector(x1), 1.0)`, preserving the same product of normal densities.
","model_safe_stan":"functions {
  real coupling(int t, int n, int N_node, matrix x1, matrix z, matrix K) {
    // sum( K * (x1_i - x1) )
    real s = 0.0;
    for (i in 1 : N_node) {
      s = s + K[n, i] * (x1[i, t] - x1[n, t]);
    }
    return s;
  }
}
data {
  int<lower=1> N_time;
  int<lower=1> N_node;
  vector[N_node * N_time] x1_sim;
  matrix[N_node, N_node] K; // CM
  real dt;
  real tau;
}
transformed data {
  real I1 = 3.1;
}
parameters {
  vector<lower=-3.5, upper=-1.5>[N_node] x0; // m
  vector[N_node] x1_init;
  vector[N_node] z_init;
}
model {
  matrix[N_node, N_time] x1;
  matrix[N_node, N_time] z;

  // priors
  x1_init ~ normal(-2.0, 0.1);
  z_init ~ normal(4.0, 0.1);
  x0 ~ cauchy(-1.3, 1.0);

  x1[ : , 1] = x1_init;
  z[ : , 1] = z_init;

  for (t in 1 : (N_time - 1)) {
    for (n in 1 : N_node) {
      x1[n, t + 1] = x1[n, t]
                     + dt
                       * (-(x1[n, t] ^ 3) - 2 * (x1[n, t] ^ 2) + 1 - z[n, t]
                          + I1);
      z[n, t + 1] = z[n, t]
                    + dt * tau
                      * (4 * (x1[n, t] - x0[n]) - z[n, t]
                         - coupling(t, n, N_node, x1, z, K));
    }
  }

  // likelihood
  x1_sim ~ normal(to_vector(x1), 1.0);
}
